    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39251" root="نبض" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْبَضٌ</span></b> , (S, K,) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْبَضَةٌ</span></b> , (A,) The <i>wooden
mallet with which one separates and loosens cotton
by striking with it the string of a bow;</i> syn.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْدَفٌ</span>, like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِحْبَضٌ</span>; (S;) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْدَفَةٌ</span>: (A, K:)
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنَابِضُ</span> is said by Kh to occur in poetry as [its
pl.,] meaning <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنَادِفُ</span>. (S.)

